@startuml uc1-signup
title UC1 Sign up / Admin Sign up: Clean Architecture classes

skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam nodesep 40
skinparam ranksep 50
hide empty members

package "Interface Adapters" as IA #DDEBFF {
  class SignupController {
    + execute(username, id, email,\n  password1, password2) : void
  }
  class AdminSignupController {
    + execute(username, id, email,\n  password1, password2, inviteCode) : void
  }
  class SignupPresenter
  class AdminSignupPresenter
  class SignupViewModel
  class AdminSignupViewModel
  class LoginViewModel
}

package "Application Business Rules" as ABR #FDE2E2 {
  class SignupInputData {
    username, id, email,
    password, repeatPassword
  }
  class AdminSignupInputData {
    username, id, email, password,
    repeatPassword, inviteCode
  }
  interface SignupInputBoundary
  interface AdminSignupInputBoundary
  interface SignupOutputBoundary
  interface AdminSignupOutputBoundary
  class SignupInteractor {
    + execute(inputData) : void
  }
  class AdminSignupInteractor {
    - expectedInviteCode : String
    + execute(inputData) : void
  }
  interface SignupUserDataAccessInterface {
    + existsById(id) : boolean
    + existsByEmail(email) : boolean
    + save(user) : void
  }
  interface AdminSignupUserDataAccessInterface {
    + existsById(id) : boolean
    + existsByEmail(email) : boolean
    + save(user) : void
  }
}

package "Enterprise Business Rules" as EBR #FFF4D6 {
  class UserFactory {
    + create(...) : User
  }
  class User
}

package "Frameworks & Drivers: View" as FDV #E2F4E2 {
  class SignupView
  class AdminSignupView
}

package "Frameworks & Drivers: Data Access" as FDD #E2F4E2 {
  class FileUserDataAccessObject
}

IA -[hidden]right- ABR
ABR -[hidden]right- EBR
IA -[hidden]down- FDV
ABR -[hidden]down- FDD

SignupController -[hidden]down- AdminSignupController
AdminSignupController -[hidden]down- SignupPresenter
SignupPresenter -down-> SignupViewModel
AdminSignupPresenter -down-> AdminSignupViewModel
SignupPresenter -down-> LoginViewModel : after sign up
AdminSignupPresenter -down-> LoginViewModel : after sign up

SignupInputData -[hidden]down- AdminSignupInputData
AdminSignupInputData -[hidden]down- SignupInputBoundary
SignupInputBoundary -[hidden]down- AdminSignupInputBoundary
AdminSignupInputBoundary -[hidden]down- SignupOutputBoundary
SignupOutputBoundary -[hidden]down- AdminSignupOutputBoundary

SignupController -right-> SignupInputData : creates
SignupController -right-> SignupInputBoundary
AdminSignupController -right-> AdminSignupInputData : creates
AdminSignupController -right-> AdminSignupInputBoundary
SignupPresenter -right-|> SignupOutputBoundary
AdminSignupPresenter -right-|> AdminSignupOutputBoundary

SignupInteractor -left-|> SignupInputBoundary
SignupInteractor -left-> SignupOutputBoundary
AdminSignupInteractor -left-|> AdminSignupInputBoundary
AdminSignupInteractor -left-> AdminSignupOutputBoundary
SignupInteractor -down-> SignupUserDataAccessInterface
AdminSignupInteractor -down-> AdminSignupUserDataAccessInterface
SignupInteractor -right-> UserFactory
AdminSignupInteractor -right-> UserFactory
UserFactory .down.> User : creates

SignupView -up-> SignupController : calls
SignupView -up-> SignupViewModel : listens
AdminSignupView -up-> AdminSignupController : calls
AdminSignupView -up-> AdminSignupViewModel : listens

FileUserDataAccessObject -up-|> SignupUserDataAccessInterface
FileUserDataAccessObject -up-|> AdminSignupUserDataAccessInterface
FileUserDataAccessObject .up.> User : saves / loads

note bottom of SignupView
  SignupView (adopter sign up) is not
  added to the main window yet.
end note

@enduml
